    "text": "cbs2iowa.com\nwebsite\nDecorah\nCollege Team of the Century #22: 2018 Luther softball\nBy Owen Siebring,\n1 hours agoDECORAH, Iowa — Luther softball is an annual power in Division III, but their 2018 team is our #22 college team of the century. The 2018 Norse team went 43-11 and finished in third place in Division III that year. Three players earned All-American honors. This year we're celebrating...",
